Scope
-----

This license covers the project's own work only: the files under app/, scripts/, build/ and
docs/, and the documents at the root of the repository.

It does NOT cover src/, the folder the tools generate from your copy of the game and which
is not part of the repository. It holds decompiled code of the osu! client and of the
third-party libraries merged into it; it belongs to their authors and no license is granted
on it (see LEGAL.md and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md). Where a file of docs/ quotes a line of that
code (docs/fixups.tsv), the quoted line is not covered either.

